alty & Other\" id=\"engagement-not-sure-yet\"><span class=\"chip-face text-label\">Specialty & Other</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"field-group gap-xs flex flex-col\"><legend class=\"text-eyebrow mb-xs float-left w-full\">Target launch timeline</legend><div class=\"gap-xs flex flex-wrap\"><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"budget\" value=\"Today\" id=\"budget-4-7k\"><span class=\"chip-face text-label\">Today</span></label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"budget\" value=\"This week\" id=\"budget-7-15k\"><span class=\"chip-face text-label\">This week</span></label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"budget\" value=\"This month\" id=\"budget-15-30k\"><span class=\"chip-face text-label\">This month</span></label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"budget\" value=\"Just exploring\" id=\"budget-30k\"><span class=\"chip-face text-label\">Just exploring</span></label></div></fieldset><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-xs\"><label for=\"message\" class=\"text-eyebrow\">Your store prompt<span class=\"sr-only\"> (required)</span></label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Describe what you want to sell. E.g. 'Minimalist ceramic kitchenware with earthy glazes, sourced sustainably with 3-day US delivery.'\" required=\"\" data-msg-required=\"Tell us a little about the project.\" class=\"w-full border border-line-strong bg-base text-primary min-h-[2.75rem] md:min-h-control-md px-sm py-xs text-body placeholder:text-tertiary transition-colors duration-spring-soft ease-spring-soft hover:border-accent focus-visible:border-accent disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 aria-[invalid=true]:border-error min-h-0 resize-y py-sm\"></textarea><p id=\"message-error\" class=\"text-caption text-error\" data-field-error=\"\" hidden=\"\"></p></div></fieldset><div class=\"cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"0x4AAAAAAFPHbRvXxO4jVOPs\" data-action=\"contact\" data-size=\"flexible\"><div><di